```
Start at (0,40), t≈(0.88,-0.47), side=(t.z,-t.x)=(-0.47,-0.88). side*12 = (-5.6,-10.6). cam = start - t*24 + side*12 = (0-21-5.6, 40+11.3-10.6) = (-26.6, 40.7), y 15. Look at start + t*16 = (14,32.5), y 3. The camera looks mostly +x,-z. Boats around start - t*10 = (-8.8,44.7) are between. Good; the gate 24+? in front. Sky and river beyond.

The banner might block the view of the river but from behind the gate it's a landmark. The boats should be visible in the foreground.

Let's implement and screenshot.

Also, the "brand" text "নৌকা" has weird spacing due to CSS letter-spacing 0.04em—still slightly weird but acceptable. Actually it renders "নৌকা" with a gap; Baloo maybe. It's okay.

HUD/screenshot after start: let's use advance to simulate 4s then screenshot countdown/racing.

